# rsync rules for the python package, rooted at packages/gbnf and anchored to
# /python so nothing here matches the other language's tree. First match wins,
# so the exclusions lead. A whitelist: anything not named here never reaches
# the agent. Adding a file to the corpus means adding a line. The traversal
# and the final catch-all exclusion are added once by assemble_whitelist.

# Tests are withheld unless a flag puts the rules that include them first.
- /python/**_test.py
- /python/tests/

+ /python/.gitignore
+ /python/MANIFEST.in
+ /python/Makefile
+ /python/README.md
+ /python/pyproject.toml
+ /python/requirements.txt
+ /python/uv.lock
+ /python/gbnf/**.py
